":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"바람에","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바람에","audio":"/audio/2c70d627030132bf596e.mp3"}},{"text":"나부끼는","meaning":"飘扬，招展","explanation":"나부끼다：飘扬，招展；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나부끼다","audio":"/audio/ed3b67b7fe40b80da732.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38867","senseId":"1","lemma":"나부끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나부끼는","audio":"/audio/9e4b314dd9854ab4fbd8.mp3"}},{"text":"머리카락이","meaning":"发丝","explanation":"머리카락：发丝；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"머리카락","audio":"/audio/7cffa7bdc9cb4857c797.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55381","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리카락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리카락이","audio":"/audio/cacfbe3db1a94bf2a5c4.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴을","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴을","audio":"/audio/0cce198792a151b686e8.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"가렸어.","meaning":"遮挡，遮盖","explanation":"가리다：遮挡，遮盖；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가리다","audio":"/audio/2015aa077867f9c06e04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15216","senseId":"1","lemma":"가리다","origin":